      "name": "EntryPoints",
      "description": {
        "content": "An entry point is the drop off location / origin for your shipments which affects your rates and the routes available. The `entry_point.id` is required when creating a shipment. You must query this endpoint to get an active list of entry points as some of added, changed, or removed.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
